<title>SINGAPORE: Omni Industries IPO 132.6 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>Omni Industries IPO 132.6 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics mould-maker Omni Industries Ltd's public offer of 40.5 million shares has been subscribed 132.6 times when the offer closed Monday, lead manager Overseas Union Bank (OUB) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company offered a total of 54 million shares at Singapore $0.45 each in its initial public offer but 13.5 million shares were placed out privately, said a bank official.</p>
<p>Omni shares will trade on a when-issued basis on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 870 3080)</p>
